<title>USA: CCC buys 5,000 T U.S. soybean meal for Russia.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 5,000 T U.S. soybean meal for Russia.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp said it bought 5,000 tonnes U.S. soybean meal in bulk under the export donation program to Russia.</p>
<p>The meal was acquired from Cargill at $312.25 a tonne FOB from Cargill.</p>
<p>The CCC is part of the U.S. Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305  </p>
<p>Shipment was set for September 30-October 15.</p>
</text>
